Webalizer 2.23-08 for Sentora on Ubuntu 26.04

Ubuntu stopped packaging webalizer, so the installer builds it from this
source when no webalizer package is available.

webalizer_2.23.08.orig.tar.gz  upstream source, from the Ubuntu archive
patches/01..27                 Debian/Ubuntu patches (security, apache logio,
                               search engines, gcc 10 fixes), without the
                               translation patches
patches/30_gcc15_int_return    fixes "return NULL" in an int function, which
                               GCC 14 and later reject

Webalizer is licensed under the GNU GPL (see COPYING in the source).
